  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Iran &#xbf; Support to the Atomic Energy Organisation of Iran (AEOI) in radioactive waste management - Component A: Iran &#xbf; Support to the Atomic Energy Organisation of Iran (AEOI) for radioactive waste management in Iran comparable with those in the European Union; the main beneficiaries of this component of the proposed action is the Atomic Energy Organisation of Iran (AEOI) and its subsidiaries, in particular the Iranian Nuclear Regulatory Authority (INRA).</narrative>
  </description>
